<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT THE PILOT PEN CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT THE PILOT PEN CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HAVEN, Connecticut 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$1.04 million Pilot Pen International Tennis Championships on</p>
<p>Thursday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Slava Dosedel (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>2-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Francisco Clavet (Spain) 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Kenneth Carlsen</p>
<p>(Denmark) 7-6 (7-1) 6-2</p>
