<p>6-4</p>
<p>11-Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat 6-Albert Costa (Spain) 6-3</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>7-Tim Henman (Britain) beat Brett Steven (New Zealand) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
